        <activityName xml:lang="en">Diethylene glycol, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Diethylene glycol, at plant
This Multi-Output inventory is based on literature sources that are based on actual plant throughputs and measurements. The oxidation of ethylene oxide leads to three coproducts: ethylene glycol, diethylene glycol (DEG) and triethylene glycol (TEG).;
UUID: ba29e071-98d4-3ce3-8316-dfc6c1861c18
includes precursors, transports and infrastructure
Location: RER
Technology: represents a current cross-section of actual plants in Europe
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: see technology 
Extrapolations: see technology
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_ba29e071-98d4-3ce3-8316-dfc6c1861c18.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
